$string = "- Pete will change equipment quickly. Rather than trying to visually read what he will use, you should try and predict what he will use instead.<br><br>- As Pete will demonstrate, staying in your highest defensive gear when being attacked is key to reducing incoming damage, in addition to using the correct defensive prayers.<br><br>- Pete will have access to seeds, but if some flowers are already planted, he will not be able to use them.<br><br>- Manage your offensive potions well to ensure you have boosted levels for as long as possible.<br><br>- The Noxious Halberd can be used from 2 tiles away.<br><br>- Blood barrage is a great way to gain some additional health if your opponent is already frozen and you'd like to use a magic attack.";
